      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. If the tenant doesn't have those specific terms and ends up in a dispute with the landlord, how is the \"unforeseeability\" of the event usually evaluated by a court? For example, if a similar disruption happened a decade ago, would that prevent the event from being considered an unforeseeable force majeure event?",
